    {
      "component_id": "c_010",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "For SMS and Facebook, the compatible images are subdivided in the according tabs. In the settings page, you can set the maximum characters per SMS message. By mail you can send all the images you want! \u2605\u2606\u2605 THIS IS THE FREE VERSION OF TEXTART WITH A 10 DAY TRIAL FOR OUR SYMBOLS KEYBOARD. ENJOY THE FREE TEXT ART AND DISCOVER THE SYMBOLS KEYBOARD!!! \u2605\u2606\u2605 Symbol keyboard setup With the first Android Symbols keyboard you can add special symbols to all your texts (sms, mail, facebook, blog,...). \u2022 Enable the \u2018Symbols keyboard Pro\u2019 in your \u2018Locale and text\u2019 settings \u2022 Hold down your finger on whatever textfield \u2022 Select the \u2018input method\u2019. Not all symbols are recognised on all devices! Make sure to check if your messages are received correctly! IMPORTANT:from now you should switch keyboards using long tap on s1 key",
